{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Thenaisie et al., 2022, Science Translational Medicine，神经调控治疗帕金森病相关研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将该研究标注为尚未经过同行评审的medRxiv预印本，并报告4人的相关分析样本，但没有明确区分研究总队列与FOG相关分析人群。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"PMID:36070366对应的是已经经过同行评审、正式发表于Science Translational Medicine的论文，而不是medRxiv预印本。研究整体队列为18人，报告中的4人属于FOG相关分析人群，应明确区分总队列与实际冻结事件子集。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"步态启动与STN电生理研究，38名患者\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40709562\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1101/2025.01.10.632393\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将该DOI对应的预印本和PMID对应的正式发表记录分别列入references及evidence，未建立版本对应关系。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"两个标识对应的是同一项38名患者的步态启动/STN电生理研究，并非两项独立研究。应关联预印本与正式发表版本，避免重复计数和高估独立证据数量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Beta-burst自适应DBS研究，7名患者\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40677701\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1101/2024.06.26.24309418\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将该DOI对应的预印本和PMID对应的正式发表记录分别列入references及evidence，未建立版本对应关系。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"两个标识对应的是同一项7名患者的beta-burst自适应DBS研究，并非两项独立研究。应明确关联预印本与正式发表版本，避免重复计数。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"术后FOG临床及运动学研究，17名患者\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40504072\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.21203/rs.3.rs-4058858/v1\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将该DOI对应的预印本和PMID对应的正式发表记录分别列入references及evidence，未建立版本对应关系。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"两个标识对应的是同一项17名患者的术后FOG临床及运动学研究，并非两项独立研究。应明确关联两个版本，避免重复计数或高估独立证据数量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Guo et al., 2025，DBS模式与FOG-Q结局的网络Meta分析\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41659700\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告称该研究的11种DBS模式均未达到FOG-Q统计学显著改善（第107–110行），并且只提及论文摘要与正文的步速效应量存在差异。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"虽然论文摘要及主要结果称FOG-Q网络分析中所有干预均未达到统计学显著性，但正文敏感性分析部分却报告了置信区间不跨零、p值小于0.05的相反结果。报告遗漏了这一直接影响FOG结论的原文内部统计矛盾。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "26a37eca-0c73-44c6-8217-d81ed2d45393", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T124935637721Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:50:20.276327+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "857a0672f6ca6e4f011e4f92833d9286451d4f3c79f5085fb7b27749772d90f4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T124935637721Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7fd6f9ed58da7b9e17aac479f81ba946f153977c159e8a1aa23538f61b1c58b9"}}}
